[{"client_msg_id":"5eff410a-99a3-4312-b0cb-f37debac661a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"中心正規化群は元が変換で不変かどうかで定義されるけど、正規化群は群が変換で不変かどうかだから、いまいち想像しにくいと毎回感じていた","ts":"1625448840.162200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1anT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8f19e4e-1b51-4e90-81ba-8f28a5799be7","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"群論でいう正規化群と中心正規化群の違いみたいなもんか","ts":"1625448690.159400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BBo="}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a4bebd1-6faa-4120-91ae-e2eda388b901","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"なるほどなあ","ts":"1625448659.158400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kBKyE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26128166-56ce-4965-9a53-8434b15367fe","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"会話するための圏論","ts":"1625447090.158100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hyx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ab15d84-a511-4134-add2-5465064809b6","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"圏論、流行ってるというより、適当な class に add() メソッド生やすときにその add() って演算が妥当かどうかを検証したけりゃ群を持ち出すのと同じお気持ちでしょうね","ts":"1625446988.157100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"acCnD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb3738c4-2fb4-4362-84ca-1d4c3fc8f3be","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"丁度関数と関数型は別物だよね、というようなもの","ts":"1625446095.153400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m5E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a19a45d9-19ce-472d-9c66-5cb8bc542366","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"再定義してるお気持ちは元に注目したくないというのの現れですね\n写像と呼んでしまうとその定義より何かしらの性質を示すためには必ず元をとらなければならない\n一方射は元はどうでもよくて、どの対象間が接続されているかのみを定義としてるので、これを使う限り元は見えないのでそれを使わずに証明を書かなければならない","ts":"1625446060.152700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U01D9BALEKU","U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B0J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cafc819-e9b4-44fa-b95d-d9ed6126b35b","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"圏はある意味プログラミングでいうインターフェイスみたいなもんで、それを使って証明を書いとけば、具体的な数学的対象を差し替えることができる","ts":"1625437784.147000","edited":{"user":"UG6DF6W87","ts":"1625437825.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wZ1N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2059501-8f37-4a24-8390-ffe1170f5647","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"集合より広いクラスを扱えた気がしますね\nとはいえそれより、今のところ感じてる嬉しさは圏自体の抽象性です\nある数学的対象とそれに関連する写像の組が圏の定義を満たすことさえわかるだけでその数学的対象がなんであるかに関わらず特定の性質が証明できる","ts":"1625437628.145100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZY4TS"}]}]
